        "TestimonialTradingConfidenceShort": "I-Synorix yangisiza ukuthola ukuzethemba ekuhwebeni ngesakhiwo esicacile. Kungakapheli amasonto ayi-5, ngathola i-akhawunti exhaswe ngo-$20,000 futhi ngaqala ukubona inzuzo yanyanga zonke.",
