        "TestimonialFromDemoToReal": "Ngashintsha ukuhweba okungaqinisekile kuze kube sekuphatheni imali yangempela. I-Synorix yanginika amathuluzi, indlela, nokukholwa. Izinhlelo zabo ezakhiwe kahle zangigcina ngizinikele futhi ngigxile ekukhuleni kwesikhathi eside. Manje, ngiyahweba ngokuzethemba nangesu elicacile nsuku zonke.",
